{"version":1,"content":"<p>羅志祥、MIRROR成員姜濤與陳卓賢（Ian）、樂隊ROVER及唱作人范卓賢（Jacky），將於12月31日至明年1月1日在澳門新濠影滙綜藝館演出《WE LOVE LIVE》演唱會，與樂迷以音樂送別2026年，迎接新一年。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:02:12.269319+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:20:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T20:38:17.233275+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.658980+00:00","content_hash":"270b4ca92c14d12f66fcaa7373ec7486704b4010088be7241edcddbf0fd0a808","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}